#. copies/office
#: src/js/orientation-model.js:231
msgctxt "tree:copies#/office"
msgid "New Student Arrival Office"
msgstr "新入生到着室"

#. copies/opened
#: src/js/orientation-model.js:231
msgctxt "tree:copies#/opened"
msgid "A new arrival file opens; Hakurei Gate still rejects ‘sent’ as proof of ‘arrived’"
msgstr "新入生手続票を開封。博麗門は「発送済み」を「到着済み」と認めず"

#. copies/openedBody
#: src/js/orientation-model.js:231
msgctxt "tree:copies#/openedBody"
msgid ""
"The file separately checks the entry route, a stop signal the student can "
"recognise, and the first destination. Names do not enter the public board."
msgstr "入門経路、本人が識別できる停止合図、最初の行先を別々に確認します。氏名は公開掲示へ出ません。"

#. copies/complete
#: src/js/orientation-model.js:231
msgctxt "tree:copies#/complete"
msgid "First Bell gains one arrival record; Akyuu refuses to publish the newcomer’s name"
msgstr "第一鐘に新たな到着記録。阿求は新入生の通称公開を拒否"

#. copies/completeBody
#: src/js/orientation-model.js:231
msgctxt "tree:copies#/completeBody"
msgid ""
"Route and way back remain separate fields. Bunbunmaru receives a count, not "
"the on-device student record."
msgstr "経路と退路は別欄で保存。文々。新聞が得るのは総数だけで、端末内学籍は渡しません。"
